{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Decision-Making as a Design Value.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Decision-Making as a Design Value.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"decision making as a design value decision making as a design value","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Decision-Making as a Design Value.md","fileName":"Decision-Making as a Design Value.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Decision-Making as a Design Value","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-21 00:27\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Design Values]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Design Values","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Decision-Making as a Design Value.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Decision-Making as a Design Value.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"decision making as a design value decision making as a design value","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Decision-Making as a Design Value.md","fileName":"Decision-Making as a Design Value.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Decision-Making as a Design Value","heading":"Decision-Making as a Design Value","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A decision-making design value specifies where players should choose, which consequences should matter, and how much information should be available at the moment of choice. It identifies the intended relationship between deliberation and action.\n\nThis value can call for transparent optimization, bluffing under hidden information, rapid commitment, or reflective ambiguity. The interface and feedback should preserve that intended decision condition rather than accidentally resolving or obscuring it.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Design Values","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Decis